msgid "Roland needs you to defeat the lords near his castle to begin his war of rebellion against his brother. They are not allied with each other, so they will spend most of their time fighting with one another. Victory is yours when you have defeated all of their castles and heroes."
msgstr "罗兰德王命令你去打败城堡附近的各个君主，以此开始反抗兄长的战争。这些君主各自为政，相互仇视，交战不断。你一旦攻取了所有君主的城堡，打败了他们的英雄，便取得了这场战役的胜利。"

msgid "The local lords refuse to swear allegiance to Roland, and must be subdued. They are wealthy and powerful, so be prepared for a tough fight. Capture all enemy castles to win."
msgstr "当地的君主拒绝效忠罗兰德王，必须征服他们。不过他们富有而且强大，所以要准备好打一场硬仗。攻取了所有敌军城堡便可胜利。"

msgid "Your task is to defend the Dwarves against Archibald's forces. Capture all of the enemy towns and castles to win, and be sure not to lose all of the dwarf towns at once, or the enemy will have won."
msgstr "你的任务是保护矮人部落，抵御阿基巴德的进攻。一旦攻取了所有的敌军城堡，便可取胜。不过不要同时失守所有的矮人城镇，如果是这样，战斗就失败了。"

msgid "You will face four allied enemies in a straightforward fight for resources and treasure. Capture all of the enemy castles for victory."
msgstr "你将与敌人的四个联盟力量正面交锋，争夺资源和宝藏。一旦攻取了所有的敌军城堡，便可取胜。"

msgid "Your enemies are allied against you and start close by, so be ready to come out fighting. You will need to own all four castles in this small valley to win."
msgstr "敌人组成了联合力量向你逼近，所以你要随时准备出战。你必须攻取这个小山谷中的四个城堡，才能取得最后胜利。"

msgid "The Sorceress' guild of Noraston has requested Roland's aid against an attack from Archibald's allies. Capture all of the enemy castles to win, and don't lose Noraston, or you'll lose the scenario. (Hint: There is an enemy castle on an island in the ocean.)"
msgstr "诺拉斯通的女巫行会寻求罗兰德王的帮助，抵御阿基巴德联军的进犯。一旦攻取了所有的敌军城堡，便可取胜。不过不要失守诺拉斯通，如果是这样，战斗就失败了。(提示：海洋中的一座小岛上有一个敌军城堡。)"

msgid "Gather as large an army as possible and capture the enemy castle within 8 weeks. You are opposed by only one enemy, but must travel a long way to get to the enemy castle. Any troops you have in your army at the end of this scenario will be with you in the final battle."
msgstr "你必须尽快在8个星期内集结一支强大的军队，攻取敌军的城堡。这场战斗中，你只须面对一个敌人，但需要经过长途跋涉才能到达敌军城堡。战斗最后还留在军中的兵种，在以后的大决战中也会加入进来。"

#. original: Find the Crown before Archibald's heroes find it.  Roland will need the Crown for the final battle.
#, fuzzy
msgid "Find the Crown before Archibald's heroes find it. Roland will need the Crown for the final battle against Archibald."
msgstr "你必须在阿基巴德的英雄找到前，得到皇冠。罗兰德王在最后决战中会需要这顶皇冠。"

msgid "Three allied enemies stand before you and victory, including Lord Corlagon. Roland is in a castle to the northwest, and you will lose if he falls to the enemy. Remember that capturing Lord Corlagon will ensure that he will not fight against you in the final scenario."
msgstr "三队敌方联军挡住了你的胜利之路，其中就有考拉贡君主。罗兰德驻扎在西北方的一个城堡中，请务必不要让他落到敌人的手里，否则你就将在这场较量中失利。另外，如果你能够乘此消灭考拉贡，则在最后决战中就少了一个麻烦。"

msgid "This is the final battle. Both you and your enemy are armed to the teeth, and all are allied against you. Capture Archibald to end the war!"
msgstr "这是最后的较量。双方所有军队都已武装到了牙齿，准备决一死战。逮住阿基巴德，结束这场战争。"

msgid "Switching sides leaves you with three castles against the enemy's one. This battle will be the easiest one you will face for the rest of the war...traitor."
msgstr "敌军到戈使你负担减轻。现在轻而易举就可战败敌军...这些叛逆者。"

msgid "Barbarian Wars"
msgstr "野人族战争"

msgid "First Blood"
msgstr "第一滴血"

msgid "Necromancers"
msgstr "迎救亡灵巫师族"

msgid "Slay the Dwarves"
msgstr "灭绝矮人部落"

msgid "Country Lords"
msgstr "横扫千军"

msgid "Dragon Master"
msgstr "龙的主人"

msgid "Rebellion"
msgstr "反抗"

msgid "Apocalypse"
msgstr "启示"

msgid "Greater Glory"
msgstr "伟大的荣誉"

msgid "King Archibald requires you to defeat the three enemies in this region. They are not allied with one another, so they will spend most of their energy fighting amongst themselves. You will win when you own all of the enemy castles and there are no more heroes left to fight."
msgstr "阿基巴德王命令你消灭这一地区的三支敌军部队。他们还没有互相结盟，正忙着互相交战。所以各个击破，占领所有敌军城堡，战败所有敌军英雄，这场战斗便告胜利。"

msgid "You must unify the barbarian tribes of the north by conquering them. As in the previous mission, the enemy is not allied against you, but they have more resources at their disposal. You will win when you own all of the enemy castles and there are no more heroes left to fight."
msgstr "你必须征服、统一北部的野人部落。如同上一次任务一样，敌人没有结成联盟，但是他们占有多数资源。占领所有敌军城堡，战败所有敌军英雄，这场战斗便告胜利。"

msgid "Do-gooder wizards have taken the Necromancers' castle. You must retake it to achieve victory. Remember that while you start with a powerful army, you have no castle and must take one within 7 days, or lose this battle. (Hint: The nearest castle is to the southeast.)"
msgstr "不知深浅的精灵族英雄占领了亡灵巫师族的城堡。你必须夺回城堡。如果开始时你拥有一个强大的军队的话，你就不会有城堡；这样，你必须在7天内夺回一座城堡，否则就战败。(提示：最近的城堡位于东南方向。)"

msgid "The dwarves need conquering before they can interfere in King Archibald's plans. Roland's forces have more than one hero and many towns to start with, so be ready for attack from multiple directions. You must capture all of the enemy towns and castles to claim victory."
msgstr "矮人成了挡住阿基巴德王的障碍，必须扫除他们。罗兰德在战斗开始初期，所拥有武力和占领的城堡都占优势。所以你必须留意攻击可能来自四面八方。占领所有敌军城堡，战败所有敌军英雄，这场战斗便告胜利。"

msgid "You must put down a peasant revolt led by Roland's forces. All are allied against you, but you have Lord Corlagon, an experienced hero, to help you. Capture all enemy castles to win."
msgstr "你必须平息一场由罗兰德领导的农民起义。他们组成了联盟反对你，但是你有一位经验丰富的考拉贡君主，来协助你。占领所有敌军城堡，这场战斗便告胜利。"

msgid "There are two enemies allied against you in this mission. Both are well armed and seek to evict you from their island. Avoid them and capture Dragon City to win."
msgstr "这场战斗中有两股敌人组成联盟反对你。他们都装备精良，伺机将你消灭。反击他们，占领龙城，战斗便告胜利。"

msgid "Your orders are to conquer the country lords that have sworn to serve Roland. All of the enemy castles are unified against you. Since you start without a castle, you must hurry to capture one before the end of the week. Capture all enemy castles for victory."
msgstr "国王命令你征服效忠罗兰德的乡间的君主。他们组成了联盟对抗你。战斗开始时，你没有城镇，必须在一星期内攻战一座。占领所有敌军城堡，这场战斗便告胜利。"

#. original: Find the Crown before Roland's heroes find it.  Archibald will need the Crown for the final battle with Roland.
#, fuzzy
msgid "Find the Crown before Roland's heroes find it. Archibald will need the Crown for the final battle against Roland."
msgstr "在罗兰德之前找到皇冠。阿基巴德王在与罗兰德的最后决战中需要这顶皇冠。"

msgid "This is the final battle. Both you and your enemy are armed to the teeth, and all are allied against you. Capture Roland to win the war, and be sure not to lose Archibald in the fight!"
msgstr "这是最后的较量。双方所有军队都已武装到了牙齿，准备决一死战。逮住罗兰德，结束这场战争。但必须要保护阿基巴德王不受丝毫损伤。"

msgid "Arrow's Flight"
msgstr "乱剑横飞"

msgid "Island of Chaos"
msgstr "混乱的岛屿"

msgid "The Abyss"
msgstr "深渊"

msgid "Uprising"
msgstr "叛乱"

msgid "Aurora Borealis"
msgstr "北极光"

msgid "Betrayal's End"
msgstr "背叛的下场"

msgid "Corruption's Heart"
msgstr "堕落的心"

msgid "The Giant's Pass"
msgstr "巨人关"

msgid "Subdue the unruly local lords in order to provide the Empire with facilities to operate in this region."
msgstr "征服当地各自为政的君主，使王国在这一地区获得稳定的后备资源。"

#. original: Eliminate all oposition in this area. Then the first piece of the artifact will be yours.
#, fuzzy
msgid "Eliminate all opposition in this area. Then the first piece of the artifact will be yours."
msgstr "在这一地区，消灭一切异己。那么你将拿到第一宝物。"

msgid "The sorceresses to the northeast are rebelling! For the good of the empire you must quash their feeble uprising on your way to the mountains."
msgstr "东北部的女巫族造反了！为了王国的利益，你必须平息这场尚处萌芽状态的判乱，以消除通往山区的障碍。"

msgid "Having prepared for your arrival, Kraeger has arranged for a force of necromancers to thwart your quest. You must capture the castle of Scabsdale before the first day of the third week, or the Necromancers will be too strong for you."
msgstr "克瑞格对你的追踪而至已经做了充分的准备。他集结了一支由亡灵巫师组成的队伍准备顽抗到底。你必须在第三个星期的第一天前占领斯凯斯戴城堡，否则亡灵巫师会变得非常强大，而难以对付。"

msgid "The barbarian despot in this area is, as yet, ignorant of your presence. Quickly, build up your forces before you are discovered and attacked! Secure the region by subduing all enemy forces."
msgstr "野人族暴君统治了这一地区，但是还没意识到你的存在。你要在他们发现并发动进攻前，迅速建立起一支武装，消灭所有敌人，恢复这一地区的秩序。"

msgid "The Empire is weak in this region. You will be unable to completely subdue all forces in this area, so take what you can before reprisal strikes. Remember, your true goal is to claim the Helmet of Anduran."
msgstr "王国在这一地区的统治非常微弱，你无法收服所有武装。所以要在敌人发动判乱前，尽量占领资源。记住，你的真正目的是要夺得安杜兰的头盔。"

msgid "For the good of the Empire, eliminate Kraeger."
msgstr "为了王国的利益，消灭克瑞格。"

msgid "At last, you have the opportunity and the facilities to rid the Empire of the necromancer's evil. Eradicate them completely, and you will be sung as a hero for all time."
msgstr "最终，你获得了消除王国中邪恶的亡灵巫师的机会和必要武装。消灭他们，你的英雄事迹会被子孙后代广为传唱。"

msgid "Border Towns"
msgstr "边境城镇"

msgid "Conquer and Unify"
msgstr "征服与统一"

msgid "Crazy Uncle Ivan"
msgstr "疯狂的伊凡叔叔"

msgid "The Wayward Son"
msgstr "任性的孩子"

msgid "Ivory Gates"
msgstr "象牙门"

msgid "The Elven Lands"
msgstr "埃尔文领地"

msgid "The Epic Battle"
msgstr "宏伟的战斗"

msgid "The Southern War"
msgstr "南部战争"

msgid "Conquer and unite all the enemy tribes. Don't lose the hero Jarkonas, the forefather of all descendants."
msgstr "征服统一所有敌人部落。不要让先祖雅克纳斯落入敌人手中。"

msgid "Your rival, the Kingdom of Harondale, is attacking weak towns on your border! Recover from their first strike and crush them completely!"
msgstr "你的宿敌，哈隆戴尔王国向边境弱小城镇发动了进攻。在他们第一次发动攻击后，夺回城镇，将敌人赶回老家。"

msgid "Find your wayward son Joseph who is rumored to be living in the desolate lands. Do it before the first day of the third month or it will be of no help to your family."
msgstr "在第三个月的第一天前，找到你任性的孩子，约瑟夫。谣传他隐居到了一个荒芜的地区。如果你未能找到他的话，家族将无法繁衍生息。"

#. original: Rescue your crazy uncle Ivan. Find him before the first day of the fourth month or it will be no help to your kingdom.
#, fuzzy
msgid "Rescue your crazy uncle Ivan. Find him before the first day of the fourth month or it will be of no help to your kingdom."
msgstr "在第四个月的第一天前，营救回疯狂的伊凡叔叔。否则将对王国不利。"

msgid "Destroy the barbarians who are attacking the southern border of your kingdom! Recover your fallen towns, and then invade the jungle kingdom. Leave no enemy standing."
msgstr "消灭正在进攻南部边境的野人族。夺回失陷的城镇，然后进攻丛林王国，消灭所有后患。"

msgid "Retake the castle of Ivory Gates, which has fallen due to treachery."
msgstr "夺回由于个别人变节而失守的城堡，象牙门。"

msgid "Gain the favor of the elves. They will not allow trees to be chopped down, so we will send you wood every 2 weeks. You must complete your mission before the first day of the seventh month, or the kingdom will surely fall."
msgstr "想法获得小精灵的帮助。因为他们保护着树木，阻挠任何砍伐。之前，我们将每2星期送你一次木材以解燃眉。你必须在第七个月的第一天前完成使命，否则王国就会衰败。"

msgid "This is the final battle against your rival kingdom of Harondale. Eliminate everyone, and don't lose the hero Jarkonas VI."
msgstr "这是一场与宿敌哈隆戴尔王国的大决战。消灭他们，但不要让雅克纳斯六世落入敌人之手。"

msgid "Fount of Wizardry"
msgstr "巫术的源泉"

msgid "Power's End"
msgstr "权力的终结"

msgid "The Eternal Scrolls"
msgstr "永恒的卷轴"

msgid "The Shrouded Isles"
msgstr "隐秘之岛"

msgid "Your mission is to vanquish the warring mages in the magical Shrouded Isles. The completion of this task will give you a fighting chance against your rivals."
msgstr "你的任务是消灭盘踞在一座白色覆盖的魔幻小岛上的敌对的魔法师们。最终，你将与这些叛乱者们决一死战。"

msgid "The location of the great library has been discovered! You must make your way to it, and reclaim the city of Chronos in which it lies."
msgstr "发现了最宏伟的图书馆的位置。你必须长途跋涉到达那里，夺回图书馆所在的城市施罗诺。"

msgid "Find the Orb of negation, which is said to be buried in this land. There are clues inscribed on stone obelisks which will help lead you to your prize. Find the Orb before the first day of the sixth month, or your rivals will surely have gotten to the fount before you."
msgstr "据说找到了埋藏在这片土地中的否定王权球。你可以在石头方塔上发现此物体的线索。在第六个月的第一天前找到它，否则你的敌人将会得到它。"

msgid "You must take control of the castle of Magic, where the fount of wizardry lies. Do this and your victory will be supreme."
msgstr "你必须攻占精灵们聚居的魔法城堡。一个辉煌的胜利等着你。"

msgid "Blood is Thicker"
msgstr "血浓于水"

msgid "King and Country"
msgstr "国王与王国"

msgid "Pirate Isles"
msgstr "海盗之岛"

msgid "Stranded"
msgstr "搁浅"

msgid "Capture the town on the island off the southeast shore in order to construct a boat and travel back towards the mainland. Do not lose the hero Gallavant."
msgstr "攻占小岛东南岸的城镇，这样你就可以造船回大陆了。不要让英雄加拉凡落到敌人手里。"

msgid "Find and defeat Martine, the pirate leader, who resides in Pirates Cove. Do not lose Gallavant or your quest will be over."
msgstr "找到并战败海盗头子马坦。他盘踞在海盗湾。不要让英雄加拉凡落到敌人手里，否则你将失去一切。"

msgid "Eliminate all the other forces who oppose the rule of Lord Alberon. Gallavant must not die."
msgstr "消灭所有反对阿贝伦王的武装。不要让英雄加拉凡落到敌人手里。"

msgid "Overthrow the entrenched monarchy of Lord Alberon, and claim all the land in your name. Gallavant must not die."
msgstr "推翻阿贝伦王所固守的君主政体，夺取王权。不要让英雄加拉凡落到敌人手里。"

